  share_txt10: `Level Difference 2% Other Commissions`,
  share_txt11: `60`,
  share_txt12: `<p class="f-t-16 f-w font-color2">Duration:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            From now until a final date announced later.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">
            Direct Referral Rewards:
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            During the event, for each successful referral of a valid user, the referrer will receive a direct reward of 10 , with no restrictions, and the reward can be withdrawn immediately.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            Definition of valid user: The referred user completes a deposit.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">Example:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            a. User A invites B1, B2, and B3; A will receive a reward of 10 × 3 = 30 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            b. B1 invites C1 and C2; B1 will receive a reward of 10 × 2 = 20 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            c. B3 invites C3; B3 will receive a reward of 10 × 1 = 10 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">
            Additional Betting Commission Bonus:
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            The referrer may also receive an additional bonus based on the effective betting value of the referred users.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">Commission Rate:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            If the effective betting value is between 0 and 100 , the commission rate will be 1% (that is, a reward of 1 Real for every 100  bet).
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            If the effective betting value exceeds 100 , the commission rate will be 3% (that is, a reward of 3  for every 100  bet).
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">Assumptions:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            The effective betting value for B1 is 50 ,
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            The effective betting value for B2 is 300 ,
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            The effective betting value for B3 is 20 ,
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            The effective betting value for C1 is 10 ,
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            The effective betting value for C2 is 20 ,
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            The effective betting value for C3 is 200 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">
            The commission is calculated as follows:
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            Commission for B1 (direct contributions from C1 and C2) = (10 + 20) × 1% = 0.3 Real.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            Commission for B2 (no subordinates) = (0 + 0) × 1% = 0 Real.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            Commission for B3 (direct contribution from C3) = 200 × 3% = 6 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">
            Commission for A (from direct subordinates B1, B2, B3, and other subordinates C1, C2, C3):
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            (1) Direct commission for A (direct contributions from B1, B2, and B3) = (50 + 300 + 20) × 3% = 11.1 .
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            (2) Other commission for A (contributions from C1 and C2) = (10 + 20) × 2% = 0.6 Real.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            (3) Total commission for A (direct + others) = 11.1 + 0.6 = 11.7 .
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">
            Description of Team Structure:
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            (1) Direct team refers to the subordinates recruited directly by A, that is, the team that has a direct relationship with A.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            (2) Other teams: refers to the subordinates recruited by the subordinates of A, that is, teams that do not have a direct relationship with A (such as subordinates of subordinates, subordinates of subordinates of subordinates, etc.).
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">(3) Description of A:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            A's direct performance is 370 , the other performance is 30  (mainly from the strong performance of C3), the total performance is 400 , and the corresponding commission rate is 370*3%+30*2% = 11.7.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            Since B1's total performance is 30 , it only results in a commission rate of 1%, eliminating A's direct performance of 370 , and it results in a commission rate of 3%. The remainder is only 30 , which comes from B1. Therefore, there is a level difference of 2% between A and B1.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            This difference is contributed to A by C1 and C2, that is: (10 + 20) × 2% = 0.6 Real.
          </p>
          <p class="font-color">
            There is no level difference between A and B3, so C3 does not contribute a commission to A.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">(4) Description of B1:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            B1 has subordinates C1 and C2, with direct performance of 30  and corresponding commission rate of 1%.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">(5) Description of B2:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            B2 cannot recruit subordinates and therefore has no income.
          </p>
          <p class="m-t-10 f-t-16 f-w font-color">(6) Description of B3:</p>
          <p class="m-t-10 font-color">
            Although B3 joined later and is a subordinate of A, its subordinate C3 had a strong performance, with direct sales of RMB 200, allowing B3 to enjoy a high commission rate of 3% directly.
          </p>`,
